<title>USA: Automatic sees strong 2H, 15 pct EPS growth.</title>
<headline>Automatic sees strong 2H, 15 pct EPS growth.</headline>
<dateline>ROSELAND, N.J. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automatic Data Processing Inc said Friday it expects double-digit revenue growth and about 15 percent growth in earnings per share for the full fiscal year.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day the company reported achieving record revenue of nearly $911 million and earnings of $0.32 per share for the first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it expects revenue growth to slow in the second half but to continue in double-digits and said that consolidated margins should improve.</p>
</text>
